I'm Pan (Pan Xiaoyi).

1406
00:48:59,733 --> 00:49:00,633
I'm Huihui (Duan Danhui).

1407
00:49:01,200 --> 00:49:01,833
Forget it.

1408
00:49:02,633 --> 00:49:03,633
Don't dare to approach.

1409
00:49:03,800 --> 00:49:06,033
[No Courage]

1410
00:49:10,733 --> 00:49:11,366
[Looking from Afar]

1411
00:49:11,533 --> 00:49:12,533
Hello, who are you?

1412
00:49:12,800 --> 00:49:14,400
[Someone's coming.]

1413
00:49:14,466 --> 00:49:15,766
Huihui (Duan Danhui).

1414
00:49:15,800 --> 00:49:16,433
What are you doing?

1415
00:49:17,733 --> 00:49:18,833
No idea what to do.

1416
00:49:18,866 --> 00:49:20,466
Let's go for a walk.

1417
00:49:20,466 --> 00:49:21,700
Yeah, let's go.

1418
00:49:22,466 --> 00:49:23,366
Hello.

1419
00:49:23,400 --> 00:49:23,933
Hello.

1420
00:49:23,933 --> 00:49:25,266
Hello.

1421
00:49:25,300 --> 00:49:26,033
Far away,

1422
00:49:26,066 --> 00:49:28,000
I saw a lonely figure sitting here.

1423
00:49:28,066 --> 00:49:28,900
[Approaching Carefully]

1424
00:49:29,066 --> 00:49:30,133
Let's check it out.

1425
00:49:30,133 --> 00:49:31,233
Wanna come along? Come on.

1426
00:49:31,266 --> 00:49:32,166
[Sending an Invitation]
Let's go.

1427
00:49:32,200 --> 00:49:32,833
Go.

1428
00:49:37,433 --> 00:49:39,433
I always felt that quadrant
was a bit blurry.

1429
00:49:40,100 --> 00:49:41,000
When getting the picture,

1430
00:49:41,033 --> 00:49:43,333
[Pair Up]
did you make quick decisions right away?

1431
00:49:43,333 --> 00:49:44,666
You mean those four colors?

1432
00:49:44,700 --> 00:49:45,933
Yeah, when they sent it to you.

1433
00:49:45,933 --> 00:49:47,400
I chose super fast, blue.

1434
00:49:48,300 --> 00:49:50,033
Blue feels like the ocean to me.

1435
00:49:50,066 --> 00:49:51,900
It feels calm and steady

1436
00:49:51,900 --> 00:49:52,900
on the one hand

1437
00:49:52,900 --> 00:49:56,600
and passionate on the other.

1438
00:49:56,633 --> 00:50:00,433
[Liking People of Contrasts]
I like that contrast.

1439
00:50:00,433 --> 00:50:03,066
Stable with occasional waves.

1440
00:50:03,066 --> 00:50:03,500
Exactly.

1441
00:50:04,100 --> 00:50:04,900
Got it.

1442
00:50:05,100 --> 00:50:07,100
[Got it.]

1443
00:50:07,100 --> 00:50:08,800
Will you fall in love at first sight

1444
00:50:08,833 --> 00:50:09,933
or grow into love gradually?

1445
00:50:12,466 --> 00:50:13,466
Maybe I believed in love at first sight

1446
00:50:13,466 --> 00:50:13,966
[Only kids believe]
as a little boy.

1447
00:50:14,000 --> 00:50:15,066
[in love at first sight.]
As a little boy?

1448
00:50:15,066 --> 00:50:16,600
But your age…

1449
00:50:16,633 --> 00:50:17,366
Now, I'm a big boy.

1450
00:50:17,400 --> 00:50:17,900
[I'm grown now.]

1451
00:50:18,033 --> 00:50:18,700
Big boy?

1452
00:50:18,700 --> 00:50:19,133
That makes sense.

1453
00:50:19,133 --> 00:50:20,433
I thought you'd say 'adult'.

1454
00:50:20,466 --> 00:50:22,966
Now, there's more to consider.

1455
00:50:23,000 --> 00:50:23,466
More.

1456
00:50:23,466 --> 00:50:23,733
Yeah.

1457
00:50:23,733 --> 00:50:25,466
Can't fall that easily anymore.

1458
00:50:26,933 --> 00:50:30,066
But I won't deny that it's cool.

1459
00:50:30,100 --> 00:50:33,033
Real love-at-first-sight is rare.

1460
00:50:33,066 --> 00:50:33,733
True.

1461
00:50:37,866 --> 00:50:39,733
Have you decided on your Moonstone vote?

1462
00:50:39,733 --> 00:50:41,000
Not yet.

1463
00:50:41,033 --> 00:50:42,166
No?

1464
00:50:42,200 --> 00:50:43,500
Don't even know the rules.

1465
00:50:46,600 --> 00:50:48,900
Eventually, I've gotta walk

1466
00:50:48,900 --> 00:50:50,500
this indecisive path alone.

1467
00:50:51,500 --> 00:50:52,833
Love's road

1468
00:50:52,866 --> 00:50:54,766
is like this sandy path,

1469
00:50:54,800 --> 00:50:56,033
full of bumps.

1470
00:51:02,833 --> 00:51:05,666
[Kelvin Wang]

1471
00:51:05,666 --> 00:51:06,766
[Kelvin Wang]

1472
00:51:06,800 --> 00:51:07,900
[One Moonstone from Duan Danhui
to Kelvin Wang]

1473
00:51:11,833 --> 00:51:12,700
[One Moonstone from Duan Danhui
to Huang Jingzhi]

1474
00:51:12,700 --> 00:51:13,766
[One Moonstone from Duan Danhui
to Wang Tutu]

1475
00:51:14,233 --> 00:51:14,933
[Pan Xiaoyi]

1476
00:51:15,133 --> 00:51:15,766
[Two Moonstones from Duan Danhui
to Pan Xiaoyi]

1477
00:51:15,900 --> 00:51:16,600
I'm done.

1478
00:51:17,200 --> 00:51:18,233
I followed my heart.

1479
00:51:18,233 --> 00:51:20,733
I gave an extra Moonstone
to my best first impression.

1480
00:51:21,700 --> 00:51:23,900
[Two Moonstones from Pan Xiaoyi
to Duan Danhui]

1481
00:51:26,233 --> 00:51:26,733
[Zhang Xuefei]

1482
00:51:26,833 --> 00:51:28,366
[One Moonstone from Pan Xiaoyi
to Zhang Xuefei]

1483
00:51:28,400 --> 00:51:29,000
[Xue Xiyao]

1484
00:51:29,100 --> 00:51:30,800
[Two Moonstones from Pan Xiaoyi
to Xue Xiyao]

1485
00:51:30,866 --> 00:51:32,100
No hesitation. Quick decision.

1486
00:51:33,266 --> 00:51:35,066
I think

1487
00:51:35,066 --> 00:51:35,566
there's someone

1488
00:51:35,600 --> 00:51:37,433
[Xia Boyan]
who kinda matches my ideal type.

1489
00:51:37,433 --> 00:51:38,033
Who?

1490
00:51:38,033 --> 00:51:39,566
[Pu Yanyan,Who?]

1491
00:51:39,633 --> 00:51:40,333
Pan (Pan Xiaoyi).

1492
00:51:40,333 --> 00:51:42,200
The soft-spoken one.

1493
00:51:42,300 --> 00:51:42,933
[Xia Boyan's Type: Pan Xiaoyi]

1494
00:51:43,100 --> 00:51:43,966
Pan (Pan Xiaoyi),

1495
00:51:44,000 --> 00:51:47,433
did anyone tell you
that you looked like Bai Jingting?

1496
00:51:48,533 --> 00:51:50,733
I'm a fan of Bai Jingting
and Wang Sulong.

1497
00:51:50,733 --> 00:51:52,000
But we barely talked.

1498
00:51:52,033 --> 00:51:53,266
Honestly, I…

1499
00:51:53,266 --> 00:51:54,066
I never thought

1500
00:51:54,066 --> 00:51:55,366
you'd like boys

1501
00:51:55,400 --> 00:51:57,233
like Pan (Pan Xiaoyi).

1502
00:51:57,233 --> 00:51:58,566
I feel that even if he likes you,

1503
00:51:58,600 --> 00:52:00,333
he won't dare to talk to you.

1504
00:52:00,333 --> 00:52:01,233
If I were a guy,

1505
00:52:01,266 --> 00:52:03,366
because you are so stunning,

1506
00:52:03,400 --> 00:52:04,033
I wouldn't dare.

1507
00:52:04,933 --> 00:52:06,366
I think

1508
00:52:06,400 --> 00:52:08,333
Vinson might be sending signals to me,

1509
00:52:08,333 --> 00:52:11,466
though they're pretty faint.

1510
00:52:15,000 --> 00:52:15,833
[Three Moonstones from Xia Boyan
to Pan Xiaoyi]

1511
00:52:15,833 --> 00:52:16,866
[Two Moonstones from Xia Boyan
to Wei Zisheng]

1512
00:52:23,133 --> 00:52:25,166
[One Moonstone from Wei Zisheng
to ???]

1513
00:52:25,200 --> 00:52:27,900
[Two Moonstones from Wei Zisheng
to ???]

1514
00:52:27,900 --> 00:52:30,200
[Three Moonstones from Wei Zisheng
to ???]

1515
00:52:30,233 --> 00:52:32,266
[Four Moonstones from Wei Zisheng
to ???]

1516
00:52:32,266 --> 00:52:35,533
[Five Moonstones from Wei Zisheng
to ???]

1517
00:52:35,666 --> 00:52:36,366
[Xia Boyan]

1518
00:52:38,133 --> 00:52:39,866
Hi everyone, I'm Xia Boyan.

1519
00:52:39,900 --> 00:52:41,400
Just call me Xiaxia.

1520
00:52:43,066 --> 00:52:43,933
I'll bet on you.

1521
00:52:43,933 --> 00:52:45,033
Then I'll bet on you too.

1522
00:52:45,066 --> 00:52:46,766
But I don't think I'll win.

1523
00:52:46,800 --> 00:52:48,100
That's fine.
I don't think I'll win either.

1524
00:52:48,100 --> 00:52:50,133
[Man Islander Popularity Rank]

1525
00:52:56,333 --> 00:52:57,366
He's a gentleman.

1526
00:52:57,400 --> 00:52:58,866
He's the type

1527
00:52:58,866 --> 00:52:59,766
who cares for everyone.

1528
00:52:59,800 --> 00:53:01,700
I'm not saying I don't like it.

1529
00:53:02,933 --> 00:53:04,633
No, I think it was for you.

1530
00:53:06,433 --> 00:53:07,366
No way.

1531
00:53:07,400 --> 00:53:08,000
Seriously.

1532
00:53:08,000 --> 00:53:08,933
[Involved, blind.]

1533
00:53:08,933 --> 00:53:10,800
[Detached, clear.]
Actually, I kinda feel it, too.

1534
00:53:10,833 --> 00:53:12,100
For real?

1535
00:53:12,100 --> 00:53:13,333
He noticed everything about you,

1536
00:53:13,333 --> 00:53:14,400
every word, every move.

1537
00:53:14,433 --> 00:53:15,133
Really?

1538
00:53:31,633 --> 00:53:32,233
Done.

1539
00:53:46,433 --> 00:53:49,300
[Autumn]
I don't think they would vote for me,

1540
00:53:49,300 --> 00:53:49,933
because I was

1541
00:53:49,933 --> 00:53:51,933
basically an NPC.

1542
00:53:54,433 --> 00:53:56,233
But the boys

1543
00:53:56,233 --> 00:53:57,900
would still wanna hang out with me.

1544
00:53:57,900 --> 00:53:59,700
Yeah, totally.

1545
00:53:59,700 --> 00:54:00,166
We mainly

1546
00:54:00,200 --> 00:54:01,033
follow our hearts

1547
00:54:01,033 --> 00:54:03,100
in Moonstone voting.

1548
00:54:03,100 --> 00:54:03,566
Yes.

1549
00:54:03,600 --> 00:54:05,000
It makes it tough.

1550
00:54:05,000 --> 00:54:05,733
Everyone was

1551
00:54:06,600 --> 00:54:08,233
giving off a kind of

1552
00:54:08,233 --> 00:54:09,500
just-friends vibe.

1553
00:54:09,500 --> 00:54:13,533
But we're not close enough

1554
00:54:13,533 --> 00:54:15,633
to show affection.

1555
00:54:17,833 --> 00:54:19,033
What do we do?

1556
00:54:19,033 --> 00:54:19,833
I'm clueless.

1557
00:54:19,833 --> 00:54:20,733
Me, too.

1558
00:54:20,733 --> 00:54:23,166
I don't wanna leave the island so early.

1559
00:54:24,300 --> 00:54:25,500
I got an idea.

1560
00:54:25,500 --> 00:54:25,900
[Ma Haoxiang]
You go to the cafeteria now

1561
00:54:26,100 --> 00:54:26,400
[Strategist]

1562
00:54:26,500 --> 00:54:27,033
and tell Ma (Ma Haoxiang)

1563
00:54:27,066 --> 00:54:28,500
to vote for you later.

1564
00:54:28,500 --> 00:54:28,700
Go.

1565
00:54:28,700 --> 00:54:29,233
Who?

1566
00:54:29,266 --> 00:54:29,700
[Seeing Hope]

1567
00:54:29,700 --> 00:54:30,233
Ma (Ma Haoxiang).

1568
00:54:30,266 --> 00:54:30,766
Will it work?

1569
00:54:31,333 --> 00:54:31,866
[Moving at Once]
I'm telling you,

1570
00:54:31,900 --> 00:54:33,000
if you say that to him,

1571
00:54:33,033 --> 00:54:34,033
he'll totally be okay with it.

1572
00:54:34,033 --> 00:54:34,433
Okay.

1573
00:54:34,433 --> 00:54:35,033
I'll go with you.

1574
00:54:35,033 --> 00:54:36,266
Do you want me to come?

1575
00:54:36,266 --> 00:54:36,933
Sure.

1576
00:54:37,300 --> 00:54:37,633
Let's go.

1577
00:54:39,266 --> 00:54:40,933
Honestly, I want to ship you two.

1578
00:54:40,933 --> 00:54:42,266
No joke.

1579
00:54:42,300 --> 00:54:43,966
You guys were hilarious together,

1580
00:54:44,000 --> 00:54:44,500
you know?

1581
00:54:44,500 --> 00:54:45,800
If you become a couple,

1582
00:54:47,266 --> 00:54:47,700
you'd laugh

1583
00:54:47,700 --> 00:54:50,000
till your faces hurt every single day.

1584
00:54:50,333 --> 00:54:51,000
Seriously?

1585
00:54:51,033 --> 00:54:51,700
Yeah.

1586
00:54:52,433 --> 00:54:53,466
But no need to force it.

1587
00:54:53,466 --> 00:54:55,300
Now, I need a vote.

1588
00:54:55,300 --> 00:54:57,100
They're chatting over there.

1589
00:54:57,100 --> 00:54:59,333
Bro, we're not even on the same page.

1590
00:54:59,333 --> 00:55:00,200
Say that again.

1591
00:55:00,500 --> 00:55:01,566
Forget it.

1592
00:55:02,266 --> 00:55:03,100
It's fine, we can…

1593
00:55:03,100 --> 00:55:03,900
So many people there.

1594
00:55:03,900 --> 00:55:05,133
Let's take a peek.

1595
00:55:05,133 --> 00:55:06,066
[Kong Xichen]
Autumn wants to see you.

1596
00:55:06,100 --> 00:55:06,566
[Ma Haoxiang]
For real?

1597
00:55:06,700 --> 00:55:07,300
[Yep.]

1598
00:55:07,733 --> 00:55:08,666
A date?

1599
00:55:09,300 --> 00:55:10,433
Why me?

1600
00:55:10,466 --> 00:55:11,066
[Ma goes out.]

1601
00:55:11,066 --> 00:55:12,100
Autumn?

1602
00:55:12,500 --> 00:55:13,933
I want to discuss something with you.

1603
00:55:14,266 --> 00:55:15,133
Who asked him out?

1604
00:55:15,133 --> 00:55:15,600
Who?

1605
00:55:16,666 --> 00:55:17,166
Let me see.

1606
00:55:17,200 --> 00:55:18,100
[Rubbernecking]

1607
00:55:19,466 --> 00:55:20,333
Just walking.

1608
00:55:20,333 --> 00:55:22,133
We can go on a date together.

1609
00:55:23,033 --> 00:55:24,566
If that counts, we surely can.

1610
00:55:24,600 --> 00:55:26,400
We're already on a date.

1611
00:55:26,400 --> 00:55:27,133
Right.

1612
00:55:27,800 --> 00:55:28,400
[Grinning Ear to Ear]

1613
00:55:28,400 --> 00:55:29,866
My mission's done.

1614
00:55:29,866 --> 00:55:31,333
Date, get it?

1615
00:55:33,066 --> 00:55:34,533
This is so funny.

1616
00:55:37,200 --> 00:55:38,333
Might as well give him

1617
00:55:38,333 --> 00:55:40,133
all five of my Moonstones.

1618
00:55:44,433 --> 00:55:44,733
[Five Moonstones from Autumn
to Ma Haoxiang]

1619
00:55:44,733 --> 00:55:45,266
Bye.

1620
00:55:45,300 --> 00:55:46,833
[Five Moonstones from Ma Haoxiang
to Autumn]

1621
00:55:59,133 --> 00:56:01,200
Yesterday, we made a decision.

1622
00:56:01,233 --> 00:56:02,900
I'm sorry, everyone.

1623
00:56:02,933 --> 00:56:04,966
[Sorry, everyone.]

1624
00:56:05,400 --> 00:56:07,333
I'll make it up to you.

1625
00:56:09,066 --> 00:56:10,333
Starting fresh.

1626
00:56:10,333 --> 00:56:13,966
[Island of Affection Day 2]

1627
00:56:17,900 --> 00:56:21,166
The first day on the Island of Affection
is wrapping up.

1628
00:56:21,200 --> 00:56:22,500
Islanders,

1629
00:56:22,500 --> 00:56:25,500
don't forget to download Soul.

1630
00:56:25,500 --> 00:56:28,766
Stay tuned for tomorrow's journey.

1631
00:56:28,800 --> 00:56:31,333
[Next Episode]
The departure countdown has begun.

1632
00:56:31,333 --> 00:56:32,766
[Departure countdown begins.]
No, mobilize first.

1633
00:56:32,800 --> 00:56:33,933
I'll cook with him.

1634
00:56:33,933 --> 00:56:34,766
I'm sticking close to him.

1635
00:56:35,733 --> 00:56:36,766
Pan (Pan Xiaoyi) grew up.

1636
00:56:36,800 --> 00:56:38,500
Why does this feel like an announcement?

1637
00:56:39,333 --> 00:56:40,166
So my type.

1638
00:56:40,200 --> 00:56:41,200
Too bad.

1639
00:56:41,200 --> 00:56:43,133
I accidentally split you up.

1640
00:56:43,133 --> 00:56:44,766
I'm even more lost than yesterday.

1641
00:56:44,800 --> 00:56:45,800
Do you want to stay here?

1642
00:56:45,800 --> 00:56:47,200
Of course I do.

1643
00:56:47,200 --> 00:56:48,233
Zero initiative.

1644
00:56:48,233 --> 00:56:49,166
What is he thinking?

1645
00:56:49,200 --> 00:56:50,666
Not feeling well.

1646
00:57:01,466 --> 00:57:03,166
Can I see Duan Danhui?

1647
00:57:03,200 --> 00:57:03,800
Me?

1648
00:57:03,800 --> 00:57:05,200
You're being weird.

1649
00:57:05,200 --> 00:57:06,900
Did someone say something?

1650
00:57:06,900 --> 00:57:08,166
Surprised?

1651
00:57:08,200 --> 00:57:08,833
Yeah.

1652
00:57:08,833 --> 00:57:10,466
I hate this vibe.

1653
00:57:10,466 --> 00:57:11,533
I'd only pick you.

1654
00:57:11,533 --> 00:57:13,600
How can I drop hints

1655
00:57:13,633 --> 00:57:15,033
to get you to choose me, too?

1656
00:57:15,033 --> 00:57:16,366
You're who I wanna know most.

1657
00:57:16,400 --> 00:57:18,200
It was already a bold step for me

1658
00:57:18,200 --> 00:57:19,866
to invite you to chat.

1659
00:57:19,866 --> 00:57:20,866
If he liked me even a bit,

1660
00:57:20,866 --> 00:57:22,000
he'd make the first move.

1661
00:57:22,033 --> 00:57:23,366
Then, I'd reciprocate.

1662
00:57:23,400 --> 00:57:24,200
What I see

1663
00:57:24,200 --> 00:57:26,133
is what I get.

1664
00:57:26,133 --> 00:57:28,433
No need for more questions.

1665
00:57:28,466 --> 00:57:30,900
This show's pure drama.

1666
00:57:30,900 --> 00:57:31,700
[Day 2 Departure Countdown]
Whatever.

1667
00:57:31,700 --> 00:57:32,733
I just like him.

1668
00:57:32,733 --> 00:57:35,000
Welcome to YOUKU's brand-new show,

1669
00:57:35,033 --> 00:57:36,733
Love Wins All.

1670
00:57:36,800 --> 00:57:39,000
[Preview of Affection Diaries]

1671
00:57:39,100 --> 00:57:40,966
Do you usually watch dating shows?

1672
00:57:41,000 --> 00:57:41,900
Obsessed with them.

1673
00:57:41,900 --> 00:57:44,200
Yeah, I've seen clips of you two.

1674
00:57:48,100 --> 00:57:48,933
[Heroine]

1675
00:57:49,133 --> 00:57:50,966
